{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/121021-demon-form-and-compromise-checks","id":121021,"title":"Demon Form and Compromise Checks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-28T10:32:41-07:00","id":121021,"title":"Demon Form and Compromise Checks","content":"So.... when one uses partial transformation to cherry pick abilities, its obvious which Cover one keeps using for Compromise checks.<br /> <br /> When one Goes Loud, you've already committed the ultimate breach of Cover.<br /> <br /> <br /> However, the regular Demon Form? You don't have a Cover up, putting it effectively at 0. But you are still rolling Compromise checks. I'm assuming from powers, revealing information about yourself, and the like, depending. You absolutely still roll compromise for having it up for more than one scene. But.... what are you rolling compromise checks with? You don't have Cover up.<br /> <br /> What about the Cover Conditions you pick up as a result of compromise checks while in Demon Form? I'm assuming that its applied to the same one you roll. I had thought about rolling 10-Premium for Demon Form compromises as a dice pool, but <br /> <br /> This in-between form is confusing to me. It doesn't feel right, game wise, to me to be making checks while in the demon form, and yet there is call for it by the rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 04-28-2014, 01:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T10:42:09-07:00","id":121029,"title":"","content":"The Cover you were in before you assumed demonic form would seem to be the self-evident answer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T22:49:15-07:00","id":121509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/121021-demon-form-and-compromise-checks?p=121029#post121029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Cover you were in before you assumed demonic form would seem to be the self-evident answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be my call, as well. Assuming Demon Form doesn't cost Aether, but changing Covers does (as does simply assuming one of your Covers from Demon Form). My reading would say that, while in Demon Form, you still &quot;read&quot; as your last active Cover, at least for the purposes of Compromises.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2630-mayberry","name":"Mayberry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2630_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T06:35:59-07:00","id":121672,"title":"","content":"Huh.... that really feels off to me. Like its being treated as an extended partial transformation. Mm....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T08:13:44-07:00","id":121711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/121021-demon-form-and-compromise-checks?p=121672#post121672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh.... that really feels off to me. Like its being treated as an extended partial transformation. Mm....</div> </div> </div> </div>Think of it like this: Demon's are themselves a foreign and alien entity to reality itself - if they simply exist reality does its damnedest to remove them - not the god machine, reality itself. Now, a demon is a strong enough entity to force its existence through pure force of will, but the process is kind of like the cosmic version of having a shouting match with your unruly roomate - you'll live to fight another day, but everyone nearby will know too.<br /> <br /> So, when a demon transforms, they normally hold on to one last thing to dodge this cosmic shouting match - they hold on to their cover's name. It's not super effective: anyone dealing with them knows a giant monstrosity is tearing apart the neighbourhood, but reality is pretty sure that the conciousness in existence is little Timmy, not a beast with pincers in the fourth dimension.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1085-oddness","name":"Oddness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T14:26:55-07:00","id":126979,"title":"","content":"Well, demons have no cover rating. The way I figured is that the cover roll is delayed until the next time you assume a cover. You can enjoy your cosmic power now, and suffer the consequences later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T16:00:29-07:00","id":127037,"title":"","content":"I'm away from my book at the moment, but I wad under the impression that failing a compromise check while out of cover caused you to immediately gain one of the demonic conditions and basically flag your location for an angelic hit squad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1178-ravenmancer","name":"Ravenmancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T04:42:53-07:00","id":128145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/121021-demon-form-and-compromise-checks?p=121672#post121672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh.... that really feels off to me. Like its being treated as an extended partial transformation. Mm....</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T13:27:30-07:00","id":132730,"title":"","content":"I admit that the compromise checks affecting the Cover you switched out of feels weird to me, even if it's the easiest to track. I am toying with the idea of allowing the demon to choose which Cover is used whenever a compromise roll is called for. Gut check is that the fact that you can use your highest Cover rating at will is balanced by the fact that doing so endangers that Cover, but that's just my first blush opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T13:49:25-07:00","id":132761,"title":"","content":"I'd just have it target the most relevant cover.<br /> <br /> example: You have three covers A,B, and C. You are in C's house while wearing A then before anyone (or thing) spots you you assume demonic form, The check would fall to C because that cover is the most connected to the scene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T14:03:38-07:00","id":132769,"title":"","content":"While not too complicated, that seems more complicated and unnecessary when you can simply say that whatever Cover you were in when you took Demonic Form bites the bullet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:00:23-07:00","id":133808,"title":"","content":"So I finally got back to my book. It's on page 209. You gain a Demonic Condition whenever you fail a Compromise roll while in demonic form. You're not affected by the compromise in the normal way.<br /> <br /> Don't know where I was getting the Angelic ping idea from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1178-ravenmancer","name":"Ravenmancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}